sgp4
------------------------------------------
Simplified perturbations models

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libsgp4-devel-3.0-1bl1
  libsgp4_3-3.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/dnwrnr/sgp4

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/dnwrnr/sgp4/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sgp4-3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sgp4-3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sgp4-3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sgp4-3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsgp4_3-3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsgp4-devel-3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

